#: base/templates/base/about.html:81
msgid "Ability to efficiently build scalable, secure, and innovative systems."
msgstr ""
"Capacité à concevoir efficacement des systèmes évolutifs, sécurisés et "
"innovants."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:86
msgid ""
"And a large number of skilled people in several key roles that complement "
"the leadership team and support the business's growth."
msgstr ""
"Ainsi qu'un grand nombre de talents occupant des rôles clés qui complètent "
"l'équipe dirigeante et soutiennent la croissance de l'entreprise."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:91
msgid "Our Values"
msgstr "Nos Valeurs"

#: base/templates/base/about.html:92
msgid "Integrity"
msgstr "Intégrité"

#: base/templates/base/about.html:92
msgid "Transparency and ethical practices form the foundation of our work."
msgstr ""
"La transparence et les pratiques éthiques constituent le socle de notre "
"travail."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:93
msgid "Excellence"
msgstr "Excellence"

#: base/templates/base/about.html:93
msgid "We strive for the highest standards in every project we undertake."
msgstr ""
"Nous visons les normes les plus élevées dans chaque projet que nous "
"entreprenons."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:94
msgid "Collaboration"
msgstr "Collaboration"

#: base/templates/base/about.html:94
msgid "We build long-term partnerships based on trust and shared goals."
msgstr ""
"Nous bâtissons des partenariats à long terme fondés sur la confiance et des "
"objectifs partagés."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:99
msgid "Looking Ahead"
msgstr "Perspectives d'Avenir"

#: base/templates/base/about.html:101
msgid ""
"As Morocco’s public procurement sector continues to grow, eMarches is "
"committed to staying at the forefront of this dynamic market. We aim to "
"expand our services, embrace new technologies, and support even more "
"businesses in achieving their goals."
msgstr ""
"Alors que le secteur des marchés publics au Maroc continue de croître, "
"eMarches s'engage à rester à la pointe de ce marché dynamique. Nous "
"ambitionnons d'élargir nos services, d'adopter de nouvelles technologies et "
"d'accompagner encore plus d'entreprises vers la réussite."

#: base/templates/base/about.html:107
